      "content": "it's not really severe though, it just happens for a second when i get up from the couch. i'm not fainting or anything, just a bit woozy. i feel like going to urgent care for just a little lightheadedness is a bit overkill and expensive. if i just take it at night instead of the morning, wouldn't that help me sleep through the dizzy part so i don't even notice it? seems like a much easier fix than making an appointment.",
